title = "Last Chance - Allies"

[Options]
[A.]
<h2>~mLast Chance - Allies</h2>
<br><i>~yCapienda rebus in malis praeceps via est. 
---Seneka,Agamemnon<br></i>
<p>You've chased away the enemy, far away from your Island. The enemy - fleeing from your pursuit - calls for reinforcements.
Suddenly you are the one who's being pursuaded along with your ally. Then you decide it's time to end this, your ally thinks the same too.
The skies thundered, a sudden flash.... Another island appears. What could this be?
$Button=More,Tell,More

[More]
<h2>~gThe master of the <i>~rChidory</i>:</h2>
"Master, it seems that we've angered the furies - with our wars - for too long now....
Maybe they've sent the <i>~yStorm Priest</i> to end theese conflicts once and for all."
$Button=Storm Priest,Tell,Priest
$Button=I don't care,DoNothing,0

[Priest]
"The <i>~yStorm Priest</i> is a force to be reckoned with master, there hasn't been any "mortal" priest who could defeat him.
So the furies chose him to be the <i>~lULTIMATE DISCIPLE</i>!"
$Button=I don't care - let's start the fight,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=O.K. now I'm scared,MissionAbort,1

[@180]
<h2>~y A message from the STORM PRIEST:</h2>
"You foolish mortals! The furies grow tired of your insolence - and so do I!
It's time for you all to visit the <i>~rNETHER REALM</i>!
$Button=Uh!!! - I'm so scared!,Tell,Scared
$Button=What ever..,DoNothing,0

[Scared]
<h2>~lYou write a message right back:</h2>
<br><i>~I"We shall see who will survive. And I can asure you, it WON'T BE YOU!"
$Button=Send,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Victory!</h2>
$Button=End,MissionAbort,1
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,TheGreatBattle

[Failed]
<h2>~rYou've failed to achieve victory!</h2>
$Button=Try Again,MissionBegin,LCA
$Button=Abort,MissionAbort,1

[End]
